# s69i: CORRECTED entry (web-matched): title must settle ~300f post-demo before
# Start; HOLD through staging (0254=1 at commit+33 on web) then RELEASE.
# s68/s69a-h flaw: WAIT 30 + release at commit+2 = false commit (title service
# never handed off; hybrid/demo confounds). 0632=0 after staging = intro end.
# Idle player dies ~5s after intro (web 3589 game-over), so press early.
WAIT_RAM16 0xFF0244 0x0034
WAIT_RAM16 0xFF1506 0x0160
WAIT 300
HOLD START
WAIT_RAM16 0xFF0254 0x0001
RELEASE
WAIT_RAM16 0xFF0632 0x0000
WAIT 60
DUMP_RAM S:\home\dev\boogerman-pc\native\captures-us\s69i\idle.bin
SCREENSHOT S:\home\dev\boogerman-pc\native\captures-us\s69i\idle.png
PRESS START 4
WAIT 60
DUMP_RAM S:\home\dev\boogerman-pc\native\captures-us\s69i\p1.bin
SCREENSHOT S:\home\dev\boogerman-pc\native\captures-us\s69i\p1.png
WAIT 90
DUMP_RAM S:\home\dev\boogerman-pc\native\captures-us\s69i\p2.bin
PRESS START 4
WAIT 60
DUMP_RAM S:\home\dev\boogerman-pc\native\captures-us\s69i\r1.bin
SCREENSHOT S:\home\dev\boogerman-pc\native\captures-us\s69i\r1.png
EXIT